        "Ulcer disease predominates"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "gastric-lymphoma",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Mass lesions or ulcerations on endoscopy",
        "Lymphoid infiltrates on biopsy",
        "Systemic B symptoms may be present"
